<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Benoni Gold cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Benoni Gold cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benoni Gold Holdings Ltd on Thursday cautioned shareholders that negotiations on certain acquisitions were at an advanced stage.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
